# Everything in this repository is committed deliberately, including build
# caches, the virtualenv and local databases.
#
# The three patterns below are the only exclusions, and they are not
# preferences. AGENT_X_ROOT_KEY and the signing keys are the material that
# makes this project's sealed receipts meaningful: published once, every
# receipt ever issued becomes forgeable by anyone, and rotating the key does
# not repair the past. .env additionally holds live AWS and LLM credentials.
# This repository is public.
.env
*.rootkey
*.signkey
